            "review_title": "Review at Mister Lai Social",
            "review_text": "Hoan N\n143 contributions\n0\nDont know what to think about it\nJan 2022 • Friends\nOverall average so far.\n\nI was initially impressed by the Menu, printed on the very soft plastic paper which felt like silk.\nNo Xiao Long Pao but was willing to test other dishes than Dimsums.\n\nI was intrigued by the Sweet and Sour Pork on Ice.\n(See the pic on the Menu).\nWhen the dish arrived, i felt down from my dream... the reality of the visible ice cubes made me think the Cook just dumped the ice cubes from the mold, into the bowl (see on my pic, despite the beautifulness of the bowl itself), unlike the well presented and magical picture from the Menu...\n\nOverall food was ok, not exceptional but reasonable.\n\nThis place is relatively new so they deserve the chance to improve.\nWill return in couple of weeks/months to try again.\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2022",
